    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26279" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαχαλ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>loosen, relax,</i>
			
